 –11:15 AM for a Sunday Funday SUP Paddle on the Petaluma River\, also kn
 own as Petaluma’s Longest Park . It’s an easygoing\, social paddle tha
 t gets you outside\, moving a bit\, and enjoying the water before the rest
  of your day unfolds. Here’s your chance to get out and enjoy the day! #
