 ax-width: 767px) { } Find new friends and balance on the water with us. Th
 ough we launch from the heart of downtown\, the central turning basin offe
 rs a surprisingly serene setting—calm water\, open sky\, and a sense of 
 ease that feels far removed from daily life. This all-levels\, 90-minute s
 ession is designed for everyone: experienced yogis\, seasoned paddle board
 ers\, and complete beginners alike. We begin with a short\, gentle paddle 
 from the docks to get comfortable on your board (knees are always welcome)
 . Once we reach our practice spot\, we anchor together so tidal movement w
 on’t interrupt your flow. From there\, you’re invited to move\, breath
 e\, rest\, or simply be—guided by an experienced instructor and supporte
 d by the shared rhythm of water and community. #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1778457
