 --tweak-text-block-radius)\; } #block-d5c574a17fbb82ea0f13 { --tweak-text-
 block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px\; } #block-d5c574a17fbb82ea0f13 { } @media s
 creen and (max-width: 767px) { #block-d5c574a17fbb82ea0f13 { } } @media sc
 reen and (max-width: 767px) { #block-d5c574a17fbb82ea0f13 .sqs-html-conten
 t { } } @media screen and (max-width: 767px) { } Reserve my spot #block-yu
 i_3_17_2_1_1778182555900_2042 { --sqs-block-content-flex: 0\; } #block-yui
 _3_17_2_1_1778182555900_2042 { --opacity: 100%\; --translate-x: 0px\; --tr
 anslate-y: 0px\; --rotation: 0deg\; --scale-x: 100%\; --scale-y: 100%\; --
 skew-x: 0deg\; --skew-y: 0deg\; --origin-x: 50%\; --origin-y: 50%\; opacit
 y: var(--opacity\, 1)\; transform: translateX(var(--translate-x)) translat
 eY(var(--translate-y)) rotate(var(--rotation)) scale(var(--scale-x)\, var(
 --scale-y)) skewX(var(--skew-x)) skewY(var(--skew-y))\; transform-origin: 
 var(--origin-x) var(--origin-y)\; } The scale of the river as you float th
 e six miles from downtown Petaluma to Lakeville Landing Marina is astoundi
 ng. We are all specks—very lucky specks —to witness the wetlands from 
 the water. As the tide carries you along\, you’ll pedal approximately si
 x miles \, moving effortlessly through a living landscape of reeds\, birds
 \, and broad skies. Egrets lift off ahead of you\, herons stand sentinel a
 long the banks\, and the river widens into its wilder self. Along the way\
 , we’ll share stories of this working tidal slough—its ecology\, its r
 hythms\, and why this stretch of river matters. At the finish\, reward you
 rself with the optional Refresh Sesh at Sundrop Sauna . Step into the heat
 \, rinse\, reset\, and leave feeling energized—inside and out. Beginner-
 friendly. Unforgettable. Be part of nature—and let the tide do the work.
  Book here. ($85 for downriver run\, $125 for downriver run + sauna refres
 h sesh) Includes all gear\, snacks and drinks at the sauna\, and sauna &am
 p\; cold plunge experience. Bring towel\, swimming suit\, slides. Hobie pe
 dal kayaks provided. Transportation details\, meeting point\, and sauna ti
 ming shared after registration. Note: Most folks arrange for their own tra
 nsportation back to town\, but with advance notice\, one of our staff memb
 ers or volunteers can give you a ride. #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1778182555900_2
 116 { --stroke-style: none\;--stroke-thickness: 6px\; --tweak-text-block-b
 ackground-color: initial\; } #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1778182555900_2116 .sqs-h
