BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Summer Solstice SUP Yoga on the Petaluma River
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260620T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260620T110000
UID:6172ecdd61f4cedd736f94eee0179894@thefloathousepetaluma.org
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/63
 02d39abd02437a9e9f0276/1770414836353-TGPGBLBRPM49SRKDJJ1E/SUP+Yoga+2026+sq
 uarespace+calendar+image+%28no+dates%2C+just+April-October%29+%281500+x+10
 00+px%29.png
DESCRIPTION:Summer Solstice SUP Yoga &amp\; Sound Bath Welcome summer—fl
 oating. Celebrate the longest day of the year with a peaceful\, on-the-wat
 er experience in downtown Petaluma. After a short paddle\, you’ll anchor
  up for a gentle\, all-levels yoga flow on a wide\, stable board—followe
 d by a deeply relaxing sound bath. No experience needed. Just show up and 
 be. ✨ 90 minutes on the water ✨ $50 — includes all gear + instructio
 n ✨ Beginner-friendly + blissfully calm ✨ Right downtown—perfect pre
