BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Upstream High Tide Paddle 
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260620T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260620T210000
UID:d46180c385e6f342d07d36156bd29ac8@thefloathousepetaluma.org
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/63
 02d39abd02437a9e9f0276/1766988489003-E3BDKAIM0H1AN5I5VSHL/Undated+Upstream
 +High+Tide+Paddle+Squarespace+event+page+%281500+x+1000+px%29.png
DESCRIPTION:Upstream High Tide Paddle [High Tide: ~6.2 feet] When the tide
  rises\, the river reveals a hidden world. Join The Floathouse crew for a 
 gentle\, guided paddle upstream on a high tide of over six feet \, when th
 e Petaluma River opens into its quieter\, greener reaches. With extra wate
 r beneath us\, we’re able to glide beyond the downtown channel and into 
 a tranquil tidal slough—an ever-changing habitat rich with birdlife and 
 natural beauty. Book your upstream adventure here. ($60/person includes ge
 ar\, guide and nature’s awesomeness.) As we drift upstream\, keep an eye
  out for great egrets\, blue herons\, snowy egrets\, turtles basking along
  the banks \, and the lush plant life that thrives where freshwater and ti
 des meet. The pace is unhurried\, the water is calm\, and the experience i
 s deeply grounding—many guests say they can feel their stress melt away 
 within minutes. Along the way\, our guide shares stories of the flora\, fa
 una\, and human history that have shaped this upper channel—from its eco
 logical importance to its role in Petaluma’s past as a working river. Yo
 u’ll come away with a deeper appreciation for how close this wild place 
 is to the heart of downtown. ✨ Beginner-friendly 🚣 Sit-on-top kayaks 
 🌊 High tide access makes this route possible 🌿 A peaceful\, nature-f
 orward experience Come explore the Petaluma River at one of its most magic
 al moments—when the tide is high\, the river is deep\, and the wild feel
 s wonderfully close. Book here. #block-221c8d523f3452ef41d3 { --stroke-sty
 le: none\;--stroke-thickness: 6px\; --tweak-text-block-background-color: i
 nitial\; } #block-221c8d523f3452ef41d3 .sqs-html-content { --tweak-text-bl
 ock-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%\; --tweak-text-block-padding: initial\; } #block-
