 igin-y)\; } On this two-hour\, gentle guided paddle \, history comes alive
  through storytelling from multiple points of view. You’ll paddle in sta
 ble sit-on-top kayaks with an experienced\, costumed guide\, while costume
 d actors on shore step into the lives of real Petalumans who once depended
  on the river for their livelihood. #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1778182927579_2421
