 cale-y)) skewX(var(--skew-x)) skewY(var(--skew-y))\; transform-origin: var
 (--origin-x) var(--origin-y)\; } Hear stories from people who worked the e
 gg trade\, ran messages between businesses\, managed boarding houses\, and
  built enterprises that fueled a growing city. As you move through downtow
 n and along historic riverbanks\, you’ll gain a deeper appreciation for 
 the ingenuity\, industrious spirit\, and daily lives that shaped Petaluma
 —and the river that made it all possible. No paddling experience necessa
 ry. All equipment and instruction provided. Just bring your curiosity—an
 d be ready to see Petaluma through new eyes. $75/person. Includes everythi
