BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:SUP Yoga on the Petaluma River 
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260717T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260717T193000
UID:7be7f12ce40ffb0fb57e9aa01790731a@thefloathousepetaluma.org
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/63
 02d39abd02437a9e9f0276/1770414836353-TGPGBLBRPM49SRKDJJ1E/SUP+Yoga+2026+sq
 uarespace+calendar+image+%28no+dates%2C+just+April-October%29+%281500+x+10
 00+px%29.png
DESCRIPTION:SUP Yoga on the Petaluma River\, “Petaluma’s Longest Park
 ” Step away from the rush and into the quiet of the Petaluma River for a
  peaceful SUP Yoga experience with The Floathouse Petaluma . Though we lau
 nch from the heart of downtown\, the central turning basin offers a surpri
 singly serene setting—calm water\, open sky\, and a sense of ease that f
 eels far removed from daily life. This all-levels\, 90-minute session is d
 esigned for everyone: experienced yogis\, seasoned paddle boarders\, and c
 omplete beginners alike. We begin with a short\, gentle paddle from the do
 cks to get comfortable on your board (knees are always welcome). Once we r
 each our practice spot\, we anchor together so tidal movement won’t inte
 rrupt your flow. From there\, you’re invited to move\, breathe\, rest\, 
 or simply be—guided by an experienced instructor and supported by the sh
 ared rhythm of water and community. All equipment is provided\, including 
 extra-stable paddleboards measuring 34 inches wide and 11 feet long—much
  larger than a yoga mat and designed to help you feel grounded and secure 
 on the water. Come as you are. Choose your own level of effort. Flow with 
 the river and the people around you. It’s YOUR river. Come out and play.
  $50/person\, includes all gear\, instruction\, and quality time on the wa
 ter. Book here. #block-e93cdccd5861ee520bf5 { --stroke-style: none\;--stro
 ke-thickness: 6px\; --tweak-text-block-background-color: initial\; } #bloc
 k-e93cdccd5861ee520bf5 .sqs-html-content { --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 
 6% 6% 6%\; --tweak-text-block-padding: initial\; } #block-e93cdccd5861ee52
 0bf5 { mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend )\; border-radius: var
 (--tweak-text-block-radius)\; } #block-e93cdccd5861ee520bf5 { --tweak-text
 -block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px\; } #block-e93cdccd5861ee520bf5 { } @media 
