BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Intermediate SUP: Refine Skills. Expand Horizons.
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260718T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260718T120000
UID:694ca26bd9d3a35d67636f02005e7aa2@thefloathousepetaluma.org
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/63
 02d39abd02437a9e9f0276/1771627300988-EZ8VX7UK15GTDXBGPI7J/Intermediate+SUP
 +at+The+Floathouse+squarespace+calendar+%281500+x+1000+px%29.png
DESCRIPTION:Intermediate SUP: Refine Skills. Expand Horizons. Ready for wh
 at’s next? Our Intermediate SUP lessons are designed for paddlers who ha
 ve completed Learn to SUP (or have equivalent experience with at least 10+
  hours on the water) and are ready to deepen their skills\, efficiency\, a
 nd confidence. This is where paddleboarding starts to feel powerful. For $
 85 \, you’ll spend two focused hours on the Petaluma River with an ACA-c
 ertified instructor \, in an intentionally small group of no more than 5 s
 tudents . Expect personalized coaching\, detailed feedback\, and real skil
 l development. We’ll refine and build upon the fundamentals: A stronger\
 , more efficient forward stroke Advanced turning techniques Confident foot
 work and stance transitions Improved balance and stability Understanding w
 ater dynamics and river movement Paddling faster\, straighter\, and with l
 ess effort As your technique improves\, new possibilities open — longer 
 paddles\, windier conditions\, higher tides\, touring beyond the basics\, 
 and exploring new waterways with confidence. Held in the heart of downtown
  Petaluma on the Petaluma River\, this class is your next step toward trul
 y feeling at home on your board. Only 5 paddlers per session. Personalized
  attention. Meaningful progression. Ready to paddle farther\, smoother\, a
 nd with real confidence? Take the next step. Join us on the river. #block-
