DESCRIPTION:Free Community Yoga on The Floathouse Dock — Summer Sunday M
 ornings Start your Sunday with Free Community Yoga on The Floathouse Dock 
 \, a peaceful\, all-levels class held early in the morning—before the ci
 ty (and maybe your household) wakes up. These summer sessions feature a ro
 tating roster of local instructors \, creating a fresh and varied experien
 ce while giving teachers the opportunity to share their practice in an out
 door\, riverfront setting. The calm water\, fresh air\, and quiet hours of
  the morning make this a uniquely grounding way to begin your weekend. Eac
 h session is sponsored by a local small business\, who’ll be there after
  class to say hello and connect with the community they support. Free to a
 ttend\, but registration is required due to limited space. Reserve your sp
 ot here! Bring a mat if you have one (we’ll have a few extras)\, dress f
 or the weather\, and invite a buddy—or enjoy coming solo. #block-0a18e5d
