BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Upstream High Tide Paddle 
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260719T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260719T200000
UID:7dec3c80ce976b8f26e084edeae1a384@thefloathousepetaluma.org
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/63
 02d39abd02437a9e9f0276/1766988489003-E3BDKAIM0H1AN5I5VSHL/Undated+Upstream
 +High+Tide+Paddle+Squarespace+event+page+%281500+x+1000+px%29.png
DESCRIPTION:Sunset Upstream High Tide Paddle [High Tide: ~6.5 feet] When t
 he tide rises\, the river reveals a hidden world. Join The Floathouse crew
  for a gentle\, guided paddle upstream on a high tide of 6.5 feet \, when 
 the Petaluma River opens into its quieter\, greener reaches. With extra wa
 ter beneath us\, we’re able to glide beyond the downtown channel and int
 o a tranquil tidal slough—an ever-changing habitat rich with birdlife an
 d natural beauty. Book your upstream adventure here. ($60/person includes 
 gear\, guide and nature’s awesomeness.) As we drift upstream\, keep an e
 ye out for great egrets\, blue herons\, snowy egrets\, turtles basking alo
 ng the banks \, and the lush plant life that thrives where freshwater and 
 tides meet. The pace is unhurried\, the water is calm\, and the experience
  is deeply grounding—many guests say they can feel their stress melt awa
 y within minutes. Along the way\, our guide shares stories of the flora\, 
 fauna\, and human history that have shaped this upper channel—from its e
 cological importance to its role in Petaluma’s past as a working river. 
 You’ll come away with a deeper appreciation for how close this wild plac
 e is to the heart of downtown. ✨ Beginner-friendly 🚣 Sit-on-top kayak
 s 🌊 High tide access makes this route possible 🌿 A peaceful\, nature
 -forward experience Come explore the Petaluma River at one of its most mag
 ical moments—when the tide is high\, the river is deep\, and the wild fe
 els wonderfully close. Book here. #block-184fc470f9e2ded49615 { --stroke-s
 tyle: none\;--stroke-thickness: 6px\; --tweak-text-block-background-color:
  initial\; } #block-184fc470f9e2ded49615 .sqs-html-content { --tweak-text-
 block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%\; --tweak-text-block-padding: initial\; } #bloc
 k-184fc470f9e2ded49615 { mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend )\; 
 border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius)\; } #block-184fc470f9e2ded49
 615 { --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px\; } #block-184fc470f9e2de
 d49615 { } @media screen and (max-width: 767px) { #block-184fc470f9e2ded49
 615 { } } @media screen and (max-width: 767px) { #block-184fc470f9e2ded496
 15 .sqs-html-content { } } @media screen and (max-width: 767px) { }
LOCATION:The Floathouse Petaluma\, 50 Water Street\, Petaluma\, CA\, 94952
URL:https://www.thefloathousepetaluma.org/events/upstream-high-tide-paddle
